{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10006_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:645450afab3af7403bd72eb47fafd0dbb5f825e4a3c38a56e92b2c76ee568d48",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a989dd767703900a51c1c1b5e896b45a9ddccfbb98f471d2c685862faad7df6",
      "text": "课程结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a83fa1b1324f234d6378e5dbb3503ed4fddcbdf007653f499c064d1eb230482",
      "text": "花音君。\n听说爸爸很快就来接你了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a29d88caa08f032fd4a4e530d7946cceec332ee87dc2ae51888b54a36817175",
      "text": "嗯……\n呐，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d8a7ee4874da4933a5502651b205d96f9a08b378e04dfd7d03c2cdd5624be5c",
      "text": "花音一直做小孩子，不行吗？\n花音也必须得变成大人不可吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29ee28b248e38930c3835a9de0b87b3af16714cd09bd0870c12dd217aebab689",
      "text": "因为做小孩子的话，会有很多可爱的东西呀。\n爸爸做的也都是可爱的小孩子衣服不是嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f0e782a8c20e3144ef645a8dca81a3bd8e72ae1f6a26d672ed135d9ea06cd5",
      "text": "长大了的话，就不是可爱的花音了呀。\n花音不想变大……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:012839acdad853b50aeeb46ee3ffeb39cff637fcceb4c562c8a6371718a100cd",
      "text": "……花音君，没事的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8546a80f6eb7fca1d324565736975c975220dc9625069bd21bbbba642aef22e5",
      "text": "为了以成为世界第一可爱偶像为目标的花音君，\n我和许许多多的人，无论何时都会伸出援手的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f73166fb8b96b219556840013e394ac1848e095721e57848c934f769e9a31f0",
      "text": "而且，もふもふえん的大家也在一起！\n不管花音君长得多么高大……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fa7ad932ed427ce9d8971f863fe42ddb683b68eecd31de861b1b200ec0416c6",
      "text": "只要三个人在一起，一定能比现在\n更加更加可爱、更加闪闪发光的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b37e9decfa70a1aa3403e2b93b63d35f1e433db61e81ba851cbe58f07d0036",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc09e808e0e07f640a4f63f758d4ab160ffc67f30073b346527d34450fa8bcc2",
      "text": "……说的也是呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3b2807453fef3c62230eae7d14fa9757f11f44e28b9411dcf1be2963069cdc3",
      "text": "因为还有制作人，\n还有志狼君和直央君在嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54e056e2e648f9d5c134f13817cf5f16483fece187c6665ce70611cb18d4a0c2",
      "text": "变成大人的花音，也一定能闪闪发光的对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000078:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000087:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eaf184bb0ed424105578ad88e1075364aebfc73df69171edf527cedcdbef3a2",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000089:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1335ce908bed2b86969f3c9812d3cb54674c8016a4faff39995ea6d4b97f5d1c",
      "text": "我从刚才开始就一直给花音打电话，\n但一直被无视……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000091:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c34cd8ae5cfbc7eb0260365a5e203f4fd409a30091266022b873d7e15ed363",
      "text": "我只是想跟他说练习的时候对不起，\n想道个歉而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000093:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2846d5d91cabfb0d9c574b1cedac146f1844554a27ec40709788a3aa9b48bcee",
      "text": "呜呜～～\n要是关系就这样变僵了该怎么办啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000095:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb31897abbc1b6e74e91d78d4a03df6e30bcd0dc771cdd353cb23ac6e699608",
      "text": "下次他一定\n会接电话的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000098:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec843f14813be2fe1ae09149a59f5b660807d9fbbc09f5a4c05dbebbe37e74f3",
      "text": "呜呜，会是这样吗……\n不管打多少次是不是都没用啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000100:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83d64162b032c22f46c3780ed018c86ee99a9c3ec9db8fd615a59137cf412b55",
      "text": "嗯～～但是……我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000102:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11baa1e8bcbe854941b2ebc5b081f3580c0f0b0dc21fe9a11bff402bf78a2fbc",
      "text": "既然●●●●プロデューサー都这么说了，\n那我就再打一次试试！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000104:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73601fbce3319e3094336d7a0dbb76ac66ce67b5c9ae64d027b4955b5a909aa9",
      "text": "谢谢你听我商量啊。\n总觉得稍微有了点勇气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000106:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92174cdfa469bbe7353e1a34b604cf55dc3e4f382d75da234e3406b73e2069f",
      "text": "那先这样啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
